text = "[center][b][font_size=32]THE NIGHTMARE[/font_size][/b][/center]

You should have gone to sleep when your parents told you to. 
Now, you have awakened in the pitch black, and your bedroom door is locked from the outside. 

[b]Bicho Papão has come to claim the children who stay awake.[/b]

Find the keys to escape the nightmare. 
Use your toys as decoys on the beds to distract him. 
Do not let him catch you. With every strike, your fear grows and your light shrinks. 
If you fall into complete darkness, you sleep forever.


[center][pulse freq=1.0 color=#ffffff40][b]Press ENTER to wake up...[/b][/pulse][/center]"
horizontal_alignment = 1
vertical_alignment = 1
